WEBVTT

00:12:59.283 --> 00:13:00.434
not too late.

00:13:01.057 --> 00:13:02.816
And on the far right, there she is.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:06.665
She went public -- semifinalist
in the Miss England competition.

00:13:09.068 --> 00:13:11.571
The judges debated
as to, can they do this?

00:13:12.134 --> 00:13:16.285
And one of them quipped, I'm told,

00:13:16.309 --> 00:13:20.275
"But she has more natural self
than half the other contestants."

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:22.187
(Laughter)

00:13:22.211 --> 00:13:26.458
And some of them
have been rearranged a little bit,

00:13:26.482 --> 00:13:28.566
but it's all her DNA.

00:13:29.679 --> 00:13:32.774
And she's become a remarkable spokeswoman.